[integration-evidence] Prove the complete control path (complete)
Files: crates/voxel-sample/tests/**; crates/voxel-sample/src/**; crates/nworlds-desktop/src/**; evidence/clause-to-test.md
Do: Add deterministic package-level tests for automatic progression, manual slider and step actions, world resume, selected-state scrubbing, control geometry presence, and parent-worldline isolation. Keep GPU pixels out of authoritative assertions.
Accept: The complete input-to-control-to-query-to-frame path is executable without a GPU; all requested directions and mode transitions are covered; and existing showcase, purity, dependency, and conformance evidence remains green.
-> voxel-integration
